description: Custom SASS design system — no UI libraries
globs: **/*.{scss,html,ts}
alwaysApply: true
---

# SASS / UI

- No Angular Material, PrimeNG, Bootstrap, Tailwind UI kits
- Design tokens live in `src/styles/_tokens.scss` — use CSS variables
- Shared primitives under `src/app/shared/ui/` only
- Prefer native `<button>`, `<input>`, `<a>` with attribute-selector components when wrapping
- Keep components small; auth layout vs shell layout are separate
- Loading visuals (skeletons, global bar, overlay, spinner) live in `src/styles/_loading.scss` — one palette, one shimmer; never restyle them per page
- Skeletons reuse the real layout classes of the section they stand in for
